{"type": "item.completed", "item": {"id": "item_8", "type": "command_execution", "command": "/bin/bash -c \"rg -n -A12 '\"'^((formal|cosim|fpga|timing|test|unit)[''^ ]*:|TARGET)'\"' Makefile; cat cores/bench/test/_helpers.py\"", "aggregated_output": "50:TARGET ?=\n51-\n52-# Targets that require TARGET=<core_name>.\n53-CORE_TARGETS := lint test cosim cosim-build formal formal-deep fpga next loop\n54-\n55-ifeq ($(strip $(TARGET)),)\n56-  ifneq ($(filter $(MAKECMDGOALS),$(CORE_TARGETS)),)\n57-    $(error TARGET= required. Available cores: $(notdir $(wildcard cores/*)))\n58-  endif\n59-endif\n60-\n61-ifneq ($(strip $(TARGET)),)\n62-  RTL_DIR    := cores/$(TARGET)/rtl\n--\n106:test:\n107-\tpytest -v $(TEST_DIR)/\n108-\n109:test-infra:\n110-\tpytest -v tools/\n111-\n112:cosim: cosim-build bench/programs/selftest.elf bench/programs/coremark.elf\n113-\tpython3 -m tools.eval.cosim . $(TARGET)\n114-\n115:cosim-build: $(wildcard $(RTL_DIR)/*.sv) test/cosim/main.cpp\n116-\tbash test/cosim/build.sh\n117-\n118-bench/programs/selftest.elf: bench/programs/selftest.S bench/programs/link.ld\n119-\t$(MAKE) -f bench/programs/Makefile bench/programs/selftest.elf\n120-\n121:formal:\n122-\tbash formal/run_all.sh formal/checks.cfg\n123-\n124-# formal-deep: same checks WITHOUT RISCV_FORMAL_ALTOPS so bitwuzla\n125-# evaluates the actual MUL/DIV/REM bitvector formulas. SLOW (each\n126-# M-ext check can take 15+ min wall). Use periodically — the\n127-# orchestrator's per-iteration formal gate uses fast `make formal`.\n128-# See formal/checks.cfg comments for the full ALTOPS scope explanation.\n129:formal-deep:\n130-\tbash formal/run_all.sh formal/checks-deep.cfg\n131-\n132-bench:\n133-\t$(MAKE) -f bench/programs/Makefile all\n134-\n135-# FPGA timing and area come from the vendor flow, Gowin EDA\n136-# (tools/eval/gowin.py); V2 does not synthesize with Yosys.\n137:fpga: cosim-build bench/programs/coremark.elf\n138-\tpython3 -m tools.eval.fpga . $(TARGET)\n139-\n140:timing:\n141-\tpython3 -m too