ue gaps. Exercise both-bus replay with\\noffsets inside the probed word, and warm-reset scrubbing with bases on\\nthe first and last rows. Replace stride-specific miss counts with exact\\nexpected transactions for the producer-directed port.\\n\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 3, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\n…[1928 of 5000 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:c6df7ebd0c64cc53]…\n\": 292.05, \"delta_pct\": 6.93, \"vs_baseline\": 2309.65, \"fmax_mhz\": 89.419, \"ipc_coremark\": 3e-06, \"cycles\": 3061795, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 4001, \"ff\": 915, \"seeds\": [83.819, 89.419, 89.419], \"perturbations\": [[0, 83.819, 10], [1, 89.419, 12], [2, 89.419, 12]], \"lutram\": 72, \"bsram\": 13, \"dsp\": 2, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_ex/reg_q.alu_result_0_s0\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_if/older.source_4_s0\", \"slack_ns\": -6.93, \"arrival_ns\": 17.225, \"logic_cells\": 11, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_if\", \"cpu\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 10, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-22T12:44:49.029447Z\", \"slot\": 1, \"round_id\": 11, \"lesson\": \"- 2026-11-22 hyp-20261122-002-r11s1 (improvement, +6.93%): Probing the ready base plus displacement and the adjacent ADD/ADDI or LW producer\\u2019s predicted row on separate load-table ports removes the mux between those rows and lets the load-use interlock verify hits while EX computes the full forwarded address.\"}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
