ruction after an older stalled code store. Warm the destination RAM before testing consecutive replay-only issues.'}], 'outcome': 'improvement', 'fitness': 273.11, 'delta_pct': 9.18, 'vs_baseline': 2153.38, 'fmax_mhz': 85.513, 'ipc_coremark': 3e-06, 'cycles': 3131081, 'iterations': 10, 'lut4': 4266, 'ff': 897, 'seeds': [84.023, 85.513, 85.513], 'perturbations': [[0, 84.023, 11], [1, 85.513, 13], [2, 85.513, 13]], 'lutram': 120, 'bsram': 10, 'dsp': 2, 'critical_path': {'from': 'cpu/u_ex/rs1_high_q_s0', 'to': 'cpu/u_if/words_words_0_2_s', 'slack_ns': -6.902, 'arrival_ns': 17.144, 'logic_cells': 24, 'modules': ['clock_ibuf', 'cpu/u_ex', 'cpu/u_if', 'cpu']}, 'logic_levels': 11, 'formal_passed': True, 'cosim_passed': True, 'error': None, 'implementation_notes': '', 'timestamp': '2026-11-22T08:29:03.751757Z', 'slot': 2, 'round_id': 9, 'lesson': '- 2026-11-22 hyp-20261122-003-r9s2 (improvement, +9.18%): Reading the destination-indexed replay RAM two issues ahead using `PC+8` or a learned exception let a fabric register drive decode, while comparing captured load RAM rows in EX moved the collision check off the register-file read path.'}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
