Give a valid dependent retry priority over branch recovery, suppress its EX/MEM valid and controls, branch training and divide launch, and redirect exactly once when the older memory operation completes.\n  - file: test/test_pipeline.py\n    description: Exercise a warmed irregular pointer chain, an incorrect producer hint, an aliased page and a misaligned load feeding a store or branch. Check bus transfers, exact RVFI values and single retirement during delayed completion. Check the extra fetch of the dependent PC on a false hit and adjacent retirement on a verified hit.\n184b556 HEAD@{0}: commit: log: hyp-20261122-002-r11s1 improvement\ndfe88ec HEAD@{1}: commit: log: hyp-20261122-001-r11s0 regression\n026ed11 HEAD@{2}: merge bench-hyp-20261122-002-r11s1: Fast-forward\nbd098ed HEAD@{3}: checkout: moving from bench-v2.8.4 to bench-v2.8.4\nbd098ed HEAD@{4}: commit: log: hyp-20261122-003-r10s2 regression\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
