001-r11s0.yaml')); jsonschema.validate(d,json.load(open('schemas/hypothesis.schema.json')))\nprint(d['title'])\nPY\"", "aggregated_output": "Forward the producer's word index directly to the load RAM\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
