rget its cycle cost and clock margin. At the champion's 3,061,795 cycles the acceptance threshold is just over 93.53 MHz.\nexpected_impact:\n  fitness_delta_pct: 5\n  confidence: low\nchanges:\n  - file: rtl/if_stage.sv\n    description: Give the replay read, source history and associated read metadata a local probe enable. Hold the validated fabric response on architectural stalls. Align the registered collision verdict with the word it qualifies and discard pending permissions on reset or an issued FENCE.I.\nYAML\npython - <<'PY'\nimport json,jsonschema,yaml\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20261122-001-r13s0.yaml')\njsonschema.validate(yaml.safe_load(p.read_text()),json.loads(Path('schemas/hypothesis.schema.json').read_text()))\nprint('validated',p)\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"validated cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20261122-001-r13s0.yaml\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
