{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_30","type":"agent_message","text":"The parallel-read prototype matched all five CoreMark CRCs and the champion’s cycle count, but its Gowin median fell to 79.695 MHz. A MEM result still had to pass through register bypass and address addition before the load-table read. I’m testing whether moving operand capture to the multiplier boundary can shorten that path without duplicating the register file."}}
