me calls are at 0x1220, 0x1228 and 0x122c. Neither iterate nor any of its callees contains a DIV or REM instruction. Moving division across clock edges therefore carries no direct latency cost in the measured loop.\\n', 'hypothesis': \"Give DIV, DIVU, REM and REMU one shared, blocking restoring divider in EX. Capture the forwarded operands and sign flags at issue. Run four registered rounds o\n…[36991 of 40063 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:900094ddf150c1d3]…\n\\n'}], 'outcome': 'improvement', 'fitness': 155.48, 'delta_pct': 11.46, 'vs_baseline': 1182.84, 'fmax_mhz': 64.744, 'ipc_coremark': 2e-06, 'cycles': 4164193, 'iterations': 10, 'lut4': 3327, 'ff': 667, 'seeds': [61.553, 64.744, 64.744], 'perturbations': [[0, 61.553, 10], [1, 64.744, 10], [2, 64.744, 10]], 'lutram': 40, 'bsram': 4, 'dsp': 6, 'critical_path': {'from': 'cpu/u_fwd/rs2_match_q_s0', 'to': 'dmem_1_dmem_1_0_0_s', 'slack_ns': -11.246, 'arrival_ns': 21.541, 'logic_cells': 10, 'modules': ['clock_ibuf', 'cpu/u_ex', 'cpu/u_ex/u_alu', 'cpu/u_ex']}, 'logic_levels': 10, 'formal_passed': True, 'cosim_passed': True, 'error': None, 'implementation_notes': '', 'timestamp': '2026-11-22T04:28:39.766414Z', 'slot': 2, 'round_id': 4, 'lesson': '- 2026-11-22 hyp-20261122-003-r4s2 (improvement, +11.46%): Comparing MEM/WB-bypassed operands when neither source awaits an EX write lets fetch avoid taken BEQ/BNE bubbles, and registering the unused direct successor keeps address calculation off the EX branch recovery path.'}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
