\\\"\"'$TMPDIR/$name/timing/gowin_p1/gw.log\"; done'", "aggregated_output": "87.517827373196\n[80%] Routing Phase 2 completed\n[80%] Routing Phase 2 completed\nRunning placement......\n[10%] Placement Phase 0 completed\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
